	quest.09754D6EAA655930.quest_subtitle: "&cModified recipes&r keep the modpack feeling fresh. There's more separation between stages of gameplay, and there's generally more slower progression. This sometimes may be reminiscent of modpacks such as GTNH, but don't let that scare you!"
	quest.0976867E2CDEEE89.quest_subtitle: "Acquire &aReinforced Glass. &rThis is a major part of a &aNuclear Reactor."
	quest.098485A3DA0AEAAC.quest_subtitle: "&rThis modpack is made up of 2 major components; &6Create&r, and &dArs Nouveau&r. There are many difficulty / progression changes, that may prolong your playthrough, providing for a memorable and enjoyable experience."
	quest.098485A3DA0AEAAC.title: "&6Welcome to Create: Technomancy 2!"
	quest.0CD5CA758C0E3115.quest_subtitle: "Acquire a &aReactor Core. &rThis is like the heart of a &aNuclear Reactor."
