	quest.2F97613C79E85228.quest_subtitle: "&6Create&r, and many of its addons, is the focus of this modpack.\\n\\nThere's not only the average &6Create&r experience, but an expanded ecosystem with &cSifters&r, &8Diesel Generators&r, and even &aNuclear Reactors!"
